-- Three showcase storefronts for testing the custom storefront system:
-- Sol & Steam Café (zebra pattern), Chismesito Café (pink florals) and
-- Taza de Miel (honey/earth tones). NOT a migration — run it once, by hand,
-- in the Supabase SQL Editor, AFTER migration 017.
--
-- They're drafts (published = false) owned by the first admin account, so
-- only that account sees them. Re-running updates them in place. Images are
-- bundled with the app (`showcase:` keys, see src/utils/storefrontImages.ts).
-- Chismesito is a real client — get their OK before publishing it.
--
-- To remove them later:
--   delete from spots where id like 'showcase-%';

-- Sol & Steam Café
